</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- 3. 아델하이드 -->\n<div class=\"character-card\">\n<div class=\"character-img-container\">\n<img src=\"{{raw::adelheid_icon}}\" alt=\"아델하이드\" class=\"character-img\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"character-info\">\n<div class=\"character-name\">❄️ Adelheid von Frostheim</div>\n<div class=\"heart-section\">\n<div class=\"heart-icon\">❤</div>\n<div class=\"heart-gauge-container\">\n<div class=\"heart-gauge\" style=\"width:{{getvar::adelheid_affinity_percent}}%;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"heart-percent\">{{getvar::adelheid_affinity}}</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stat-controls\">\n<span class=\"stat-label-mini\">호감</span>\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"stat-btn-mini minus\" risu-trigger=\"adjust_adelheid_minus_100\">-100</button>\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"stat-btn-mini minus\" risu-trigger=\"adjust_adelheid_minus_50\">-50</button>\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"stat-btn-mini plus\" risu-trigger=\"adjust_adelheid_plus_50\">+50</button>\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"stat-btn-mini plus\" risu-trigger=\"adjust_adelheid_plus_100\">+100</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"char-tooltip\">\n<h4>추위 싫어하는 검술 천재</h4>\n<p>애니 좋아하는 천부적 검술가. 노력 없이 이기고, 추우면 수업 빠진다. 카산드라 스타일에 관심 있음.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n<!-- 4. 로잘리 -->\n<div class=\"character-card\">\n<div class=\"character-img-container\">\n<img src=\"{{raw::rosalie_icon}}\" alt=\"로잘리\" class=\"character-img\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"character-info\">\n<div class=\"character-name\">🌸 Rosalie von Lichtberg</div>\n<div class=\"heart-section\">\n<div class=\"heart-icon\">❤</div>\n<div class=\"heart-gauge-container\">\n<div class=\"heart-gauge\" style=\"width:{{getvar::rosalie_affinity_percent}}%;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"heart-percent\">{{getvar::rosalie_affinity}}</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"stat-controls\">\n<span class=\"stat-label-mini\">호감</span>\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"stat-btn-mini minus\" risu-trigger=\"adjust_rosalie_minus_100\">-100</button>\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"sta